  "description": "Rich text editor for Blazor (.NET 8, .NET 9, .NET 10) with keyboard accessibility, ARIA support, emoji picker (1800+ emojis via BlazorEmo), emoji autocomplete (first-item auto-selected on open), XSS protection. Tested on Chrome, Edge, Firefox. Native Blazor component. GPL-3.0 for open-source.",
